# Copy to secrets.properties (never committed, see .gitignore) and fill in.
# The guest key of the lecture-clip server: the app sends it with clip requests, statistics and error reports.
# Without it the app still builds (debug); clips don't play and no statistics or error reports are sent. A release build requires it.
clipsGuestToken=
# The web version's own guest key (scripts/web.sh puts it into index.html, so it is public by design): it opens lecture
# clips only, nothing else, and the server can swap it apart from the APK's. Without it the web reads clips as captions.
clipsWebToken=
